      "role": "user",
      "content": "i feel like everything i actually believed in was just a lie. i spent my whole life building this sense of purpose around things that just... evaporated. now there's just nothing. no floor, no ceiling, just this massive empty space where my soul used to be. it feels like there's actually no point to anything anymore.",
